      <Capitolo>System/fault identification</Capitolo>
      <Corpo> &lt;BR/&gt; &lt;LI&gt; &lt;B&gt; Applicability: &lt;/B&gt; Vehicles equipped with Selespeed gearbox &lt;BR/&gt; &lt;BR/&gt; &lt;LI&gt; &lt;B&gt; System: &lt;/B&gt; Gearbox &lt;BR/&gt; &lt;BR/&gt;  &lt;LI&gt; &lt;B&gt; Device: &lt;/B&gt; Gear selection/engagement actuator. &lt;BR/&gt; &lt;BR/&gt; &lt;LI&gt; &lt;B&gt; Fault: &lt;/B&gt; Gearbox locked (Robotic gearbox) &lt;BR/&gt; &lt;BR/&gt;  &lt;LI&gt; &lt;B&gt; Errors detected by self-diagnosis: &lt;/B&gt; &lt;BR/&gt; P2917 - Gear engagement/disengagement actuator locked &lt;BR/&gt; &lt;BR/&gt;  &lt;LI&gt; &lt;B&gt; Cause: &lt;/B&gt; The gearbox lock is caused by a malfunction of the gear selection/engagement actuator, which may be due to insufficient oil level in the gearbox or a malfunction of the actuator itself &lt;BR/&gt; &lt;BR/&gt; </Corpo>
